sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 操作员
    participant A as Agent (VLM)
    participant S as VLA Server
    participant R as Robot 机械臂
    U->>A: 把杯子放进篮子
    A->>S: set_task("pick cup")
    loop 每 100 ms / every chunk
        R-->>S: 观测 obs (RGB + proprio)
        S->>R: action chunk
    end
    alt 成功 success
        R-->>A: done
    else 失败 fail
        R--)A: error + 截图
        A->>A: 重新规划 replan
    end
    Note over A,S: 子任务完成后上报 report
    A-->>U: 完成 done
